-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 40 of them. In 2025 that same pair ran 27% of normal on the middle of the grids, while July to August in 2025 ran 196%. Every grid had its driest year in 1976, with grid 30130 at 41% of normal in 1976.</p>"}
